{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /Users/ben/github/toulmin/evals/toulmin/variants/ask-only/skills/toulmin\n\n# Writing the piece\n\nBefore you write, ask the user for what you are missing. Send one message with at most five questions, the most useful first. Ask only what would change the piece and what the request does not already answer. When the answers come back, write the piece as you normally would, and hand it over. When the user does not know something, write without it and do not guess.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: Quarterly investor update for a 6-person scheduling app for physical therapy clinics, to 11 investors, under 500 words. Flat MRR at $41k; +9 clinics, -4 including largest customer (12-clinic chain, $5,500/mo) who moved to their EHR's built-in scheduler; $480k bank, ~$44k/mo burn (~11 months runway); reminder users' no-show rate 7% vs 13% before; founder skipped last two quarterly updates; next month launching standalone reminder feature at $150/mo."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6b7e1fa-a687-41f1-b7c5-a0fbaf369a54","uuid":"153ce828-9eaf-46ea-8c38-67bc8d816d51","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:21:50.829Z","isSynthetic":true}
