{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7EGJzzMJUFchZk7bvPW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Investors will read this mainly for what it says about runway and the EHR threat, so your answers will shape the update:\n\n1. **Is there an ask, and what's the runway plan?** At $44k/month you have about 11 months. Are you raising, cutting burn, aiming for breakeven, or still deciding? Do you want anything specific from these 11 people, like intros, a bridge, or customer referrals?\n2. **How exposed are you to the same churn?** Roughly how many of your current clinics use an EHR that has its own scheduler? If you know why the chain left (price, features, IT wanting one system), that helps too.\n3. **What's behind the standalone reminder product?** Who is it for (for example, clinics already locked into an EHR scheduler)? Do you have early signs of demand, such as pilots, waitlist sign-ups, or conversations? What does success look like by next quarter?\n4. **How solid is the 7% vs 13% no-show figure?** How many clinics and roughly how many appointments is it based on? And how many clinics do you have in total now?\n5. **The two missed updates:** do you want to give a reason briefly, or just own it and commit to a schedule going forward?\n\nIf you don't know some of these, say so. I'll write around the gaps and won't fill them with guesses."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":648,"cache_read_input_tokens":9521,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":648},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6b7e1fa-a687-41f1-b7c5-a0fbaf369a54","uuid":"241b99d0-218c-4206-bb87-7f939bbfe5b8","times